"""Strict Point-in-Time (No-Lookahead) 7-Day BTC 1h Pattern & Signal Backtest.

For every BTCUSDT 1h pattern or signal bar t_i in the past N days (default 7 days):
1. Slices 15m, 1h, 4h, 1d K-lines and OI strictly <= t_i close time (synthesizing
   in-progress 4h and 1d candles strictly from 1h candles <= t_i so zero future data leaks).
2. Calls ezcoin-adapter (hard gates + 5-seat LLM debate: Technical, Flow/OI, Bull, Bear, Trader)
   at as_of_ts = t_i close time, without knowing any subsequent bars.
3. Evaluates post-t_i ground truth (+1h, +4h, +12h, +24h returns, 12h/24h MFE & MAE,
   and whether AI/Gate succeeded or missed) and saves to oi_mornitor/data/btc_1h_backtest_7d.json.
"""
